  "idea": "N8N self-hosted: unlimited workflow automations for zero dollars",
  "text": "You can run thousands of workflow automations every month for zero dollars. Founders often throttle notification bots and customer sequences just to avoid triggering costly tier upgrades. That restriction delays lead responses and breaks critical data syncs between payment gateways and databases. Deploying n8n with Docker gives you complete control over unlimited webhooks, custom logic, and API connectors. Your pipeline processes leads in real time without extra costs.",
